++   - Confirm the automatically generated **Slug** (`cross-proj-sec-score`).
++   - Select the **Flavor** (`formula` or `wasm`).
++   - Select the **Output Format** (`severity_pill` or `number`).
++3. **Request Elevated Scope:**
++   - Set **Target Scope** to `WORKSPACE` or `SERVER`.
++   - Optionally toggle **Credential Mode** to `SERVICE_ACCOUNT`.
++   - The UI immediately surfaces an amber **Dual-Control Escalation Banner** warning of the expanded data access boundary.
++4. **Draft and Test Execute:**
